					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6137379#post-3835755</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6137379/kte-6024-blit-nuntius#post-3835755</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 14 Jun 2018 16:10:58 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrDromeus</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3785128</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The whole deal is simpler than you’d think. There is no initial meme: the GOC created the whole mess. The email chain was all sent before the whole Operations Plains Talk deal, basically showing its path to creation. The GOC was trying to create a countermeme for future endeavors, but after the memetic wing refused to work on it, High Command took over the project, which doesn’t go so well.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6137379#post-3835533</guid>
